      <div class="pf-info">
        <div class="pf-num">06 / Cloud &middot; Serverless &middot; AWS Lambda</div>
        <h2 class="pf-title">DataInsight &mdash; Analytics Dashboard</h2>
        <p class="pf-desc">Serverless analytics platform using AWS Lambda + API Gateway for on-demand metric processing. Java Lambda handlers deployed via AWS SAM CLI with PostgreSQL RDS backend and a React + Recharts dashboard frontend. Zero server management, auto-scales with traffic.</p>
        <div class="pf-impact">
          <div class="impact-item"><span class="impact-val">Serverless</span><span class="impact-key">AWS Lambda</span></div>
          <div class="impact-item"><span class="impact-val">SAM CLI</span><span class="impact-key">IaC Deploy</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="pf-tech"><span>Java</span><span>AWS Lambda</span><span>API Gateway</span><span>PostgreSQL</span><span>React</span><span>AWS SAM</span></div>
